  <String Id="Caption">Embercrown Setup</String>
  <String Id="Title">Embercrown</String>
  <String Id="InstallHeader">Welcome</String>
  <String Id="InstallMessage">Setup will install Embercrown on your computer.</String>
  <String Id="InstallVersion">Version [WixBundleVersion]</String>
  <String Id="ConfirmCancelMessage">Do you really want to let the kingdom burn?</String>
  <String Id="ExecuteUpgradeRelatedBundleMessage">Previous version</String>
  <String Id="HelpHeader">Setup Help</String>
  <String Id="HelpText">/install | /repair | /uninstall | /layout [directory] - installs, repairs, uninstalls or creates a local copy of the bundle. Install is the default.

/passive | /quiet - displays minimal UI or no UI.
/norestart - suppresses a restart request.
/log log.txt - writes the setup log to the chosen path.</String>
